; Letters' names. Each card, and after it the record of the letters deck that ask asked for (eight cards: a
; letter name's phoneme codes, then 0s), in. Cards pass through except a spelled word's letters (100 + code, the
; last 200 + code) and its end (-11), and for any of them the record is passed over. For a letter it sends each
; phoneme of its name as 10 x code + stress: the first vowel other than AX (codes 3-17)
; gets 1 in the last letter's name and 2 in the others'. -1 goes between the letters; -20 in place of -11.
;
; Address Contents Label Opcode Operand Comment
  03            rec     INP   x        03-20: a card: pass it on, or a letter (last or not)
  04                    CLA   x
  05                    SUB   c101
  06                    TAC   pass
  07                    SUB   c99
  08                    TAC   nl
  09                    STO   y
  10                    CLA   00
  11                    STO   lst
  12                    JMP   ask
  13            nl      ADD   c100
  14                    STO   y
  15                    CLA   z
  16                    STO   lst
  17            ask     CLA   z
  18                    STO   done
  19                    CLA   n7
  20                    STO   i
  21            gn      INP   p        21-56: the name's phonemes, stressed
  22                    CLA   p
  23                    SUB   00
  24                    TAC   nx
  25                    CLA   p
  26                    SFT   10
  27                    STO   q
  28                    CLA   p
  29                    SUB   n3
  30                    TAC   put
  31                    CLA   p
  32                    SUB   c18
  33                    TAC   v
  34                    JMP   put
  35            v       CLA   done
  36                    SUB   00
  37                    TAC   st
  38                    JMP   put
  39            st      CLA   00
  40                    STO   done
  41                    CLA   q
  42                    ADD   n2
  43                    SUB   lst
  44                    STO   q
  45            put     OUT   q
  46            nx      CLA   i
  47                    SUB   00
  48                    STO   i
  49                    TAC   sep
  50                    JMP   gn
  51            sep     CLA   lst
  52                    SUB   00
  53                    TAC   dash
  54                    JMP   rec
  55            dash    OUT   m1
  56                    JMP   rec
  57            pass    CLA   n7       57-91: the record passed over; -11 becomes -20; anything else as it is
  58                    STO   i
  59            sk      INP   p
  60                    CLA   i
  61                    SUB   00
  62                    STO   i
  63                    TAC   pa
  64                    JMP   sk
  65            pa      CLA   x
  66                    ADD   c11
  67                    TAC   po
  68                    SUB   00
  69                    TAC   p20
  70            po      OUT   x
  71                    JMP   rec
  72            p20     OUT   m20
  73                    JMP   rec
  74            x       DATA  0
  75            y       DATA  0
  76            p       DATA  0
  77            q       DATA  0
  78            i       DATA  0
  79            done    DATA  0
  80            lst     DATA  0
  81            z       DATA  0
  82            n2      DATA  2
  83            n3      DATA  3
  84            n7      DATA  7
  85            c11     DATA  11
  86            c18     DATA  18
  87            c99     DATA  99
  88            c100    DATA  100
  89            c101    DATA  101
  90            m1      DATA  -1
  91            m20     DATA  -20
